# Rancang environment variables
#
# The app itself needs NO environment variables — the blueprint engine is pure,
# deterministic TypeScript that runs entirely in the browser. The app ships as a
# fully static site.
#
# The variables below are only used for DEPLOYING to Cloudflare Pages via wrangler.

# Cloudflare credentials (used by `npm run deploy` / wrangler).
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=...
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=...
